n right now. We can't take care of both humans and Nikkes all at once.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_10_e_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_10_e_14","text":"If all of us try to join in at the same time, it'll only make a bigger mess of things.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_10_e_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_10_e_15","text":"Everyone scatters around and takes down Raptures individually.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_10_e_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_10_e_16","text":"I'll try to command a weapons drone nearby.\nIt should be possible for some support fire.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_10_e_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_10_e_17","text":"The Central Government is bound to make their move at any moment. Until then, we've got to do whatever we can.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_10_e_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_10_e_18","text":"Roger.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_10_e_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_10_e_19","text":"Okay, I'll head this way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_10_e_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_10_e_20","text":"I'll go this way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_10_e_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_10_e_21","text":"... Most peculiar.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"ArkRuinIndoor","bgArt":"arkruinindoor","image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":["guillotine","jackal"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_10_e_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_10_e_22","text":"I didn't imagine I'd feel a sense of kinship with Maiden.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_10_e_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_10_e_23","text":"Hehe! You're strong! This is fun!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_10_e_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_10_e_24","text":"This is my first time seeing someone as strong as you!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_10_e_25","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_10_e_25","text":"Jackal runs forward, whipping her hands around.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_10_e_26","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_10_e_26","text":"Guillotine easily evades.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_10_e_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_10_e_27","text":"I always had her pegged as an indolent and badgering Nikke who, much like myself, had been cursed with immense power.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_10_e_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_10_e_28","text":"However,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_10_e_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_10_e_29","text":"when your attack managed to take her down,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_10_e_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_10_e_30","text":"I realized something.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_10_e_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_10_e_31","text":"You're really fast! Hehe!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_10_e_32","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_10_e_32","text":"Jackal scurries along the ground, aiming for Guillotine's leg.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_10_e_33","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_10_e_33","text":"Guillotine crouches and whips back the leg that Jackal was intending to grab.","jump":null,"